Shadow Analyzer
Don't focus on AWS.
Focus on graph thinking.
Example
Problem
IAM privilege escalation
is fundamentally a graph traversal problem.
Decision
Used Neo4j instead of relational joins.
Tradeoff
Additional infrastructure complexity
for dramatically simpler traversals.
Now you're talking like an engineer.

